      "html": "<table><thead></thead><tbody><tr><td>Name of the post</td><td>Station</td><td>Equivalent to the post</td><td>Service for which earmarked</td></tr><tr><td>Joint Director, Level 13A in Pay Matrix of \\( 7^{th} \\) CPC</td><td>New Delhi</td><td>Deputy Inspector General of Police</td><td>Indian Police Service</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
