        364.59,
        521.22,
        431.1,
        83.3,
        431.1
      ],
      "text": "2. It is, therefore, requested that aforesaid post may be given wider publicity and names of willing IPS officers of the rank of DIG may be forwarded to this Ministry at the earliest. While sending the nominations, it may please be ensured that the officers are clear from vigilance angle. The names should be reached this Ministry within a period of one month after issuance of this letter."
